        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Raja Kumari, Gwen Stefani\n- Organizations: No Doubt\n- Works: Tragic Kingdom, Just a Girl, Don't Speak, Hey Baby, It's My Life\n- Topics: musical collaborations, band roles, commercial success\n\nFacts:\n- In 1995, No Doubt had a breakthrough with the studio album Tragic Kingdom.\n- No Doubt achieved major success with the singles \"Just a Girl,\" \"Don't Speak,\" \"Hey Baby,\" and \"It's My Life.\"\n- Gwen Stefani is a co-founder and the lead vocalist of No Doubt.\n- Raja Kumari is best known for collaborating with artists including Gwen Stefani, Iggy Azalea, Fifth Harmony, Knife Party, and Fall Out Boy.",
